<title>MALAYSIA: MAS takes delivery of 4 Boeings in '97.</title>
<headline>MAS takes delivery of 4 Boeings in '97.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia Airline System Bhd (MAS) said on Thursday it will take delivery this year of four of the 25 Boeing Co aircraft it ordered last year for a total of 10 billion ringgit ($4 billion).</p>
<p>MAS will take delivery of four Boeing 777s for $500 million, the national airline's vice president of treasury and risk management Saril Salleh told reporters.</p>
</text>
